# The pad with the barrel by the hut (map 4, its window on the left) and the backpack (better inventory) open: left and right stay in their window (the window buttons go over): past the start of the backpack's top row to the end of its bottom row, past its end on into the top row; in the barrel round from its first thing to its last
args: --map 4 --pos 10624,10060,48
do: option:better_inventory,on;pack:418;pack:420;pack:816;pack:814;pack:843;pack:793,1;pack:793,3
do: t5;operate:36462;t10;inv;t5;pickwin:-1;pickrow:-1;pickwin:-1;pickwin:1;pickother:-1;pickwin:-1
expect: pickrow: true id 36734
expect: pickwin: id 36740 shape  793
expect: pickwin: id 36734 shape  418
expect: pickother: id 36463 shape  579
expect: pickwin: id 36464 shape  830
reject: pickwin: id 36466
reject: pickwin: id 36463
